#
# NovatOS package list (x86_64)
# =============================
# Read by archiso's mkarchiso. One package per line; @groups allowed.
# Official Arch repos only — AUR helpers (paru/yay) are added post-install
# by /usr/local/bin/novatos-first-run to keep the ISO build reproducible.
#

